	(text "IMU LSM6DS3TR-C on I2C2 at 0x6A (SA0 = GND), INT1 -> PB12, INT2 -> PB13.\nQwiic shares I2C2; 4.7k pull-ups, cut JP to remove. UART: GND 5V TX RX (Bluetooth/telemetry).\nExpansion 2x5 (loose header): 3V3 GND PA5 GND PA15 PB4 PB5 PB9 PB14 PB15.\nWS2812 output: 5V, DIN, GND. PA8 (TIM1 CH1, DMA) -> 74AHCT1G125 (5 V levels) -> 330R. 6 LEDs ~0.36 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 190.5 0)
